'''Bat Person Talisman''' is a {{Common}} [[Accessory]] that grants +2 {{Stat|def}}, {{stat|str}} and {{Stat|int}} for each bat a player has summoned. It can be further upgraded into a {{Item|Bat Person Ring}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== Trick or Treat Chests ===
The '''Bat Person Talisman''' has a {{Green|1.04%}} chance to drop from a [[Trick or Treat Chest]] that sometimes appears when a mob is killed during the [[Spooky Festival]].

